--   https://github.com/ShouqiaoW/erdos/blob/61325b10bbdc29f4fb5e0618b414b9f2189333ad/390/lean/Erdos390/WholePaper/BankPaperCanonicalSectionNinePostHeightSourcePrebridgeConnector.lean#L207-L350

